<!-- 手动销售成交（电脑版）：左边成交信息、物流与凭证两张表单，右边商品核对，底部操作条提交 -->
<view class="dk-page">
  <view class="dk-head">
    <view>
      <view class="dk-title">手动销售成交 <text class="dk-tag tag-warning ms-dk-tag">临时入口</text></view>
      <view class="dk-sub">扫码找货 → 填成交信息 → 一步建单出库</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="dk-split">
    <view class="ms-dk-col">
      <view class="dk-card">
        <view class="dk-card__head">成交信息</view>
        <view class="dk-card__body">
          <view class="dk-form">
            <view class="dk-field dk-field--full">
              <text class="dk-label dk-label--req">货号</text>
              <view class="dk-row">
                <input
                  class="dk-input dk-grow"
                  placeholder="扫码或输入货号，离开输入框自动带出商品"
                  data-key="sku_code"
                  value="{{form.sku_code}}"
                  bindinput="onInput"
                  bindblur="onCodeBlur"
                />
                <view class="dk-btn" bindtap="scanSku">扫码填入</view>
              </view>
            </view>

            <view class="dk-field">
              <text class="dk-label dk-label--req">成交价</text>
              <input class="dk-input" placeholder="0.00" type="digit" data-key="sale_price" value="{{form.sale_price}}" bindinput="onInput" />
            </view>
            <view class="dk-field">
              <text class="dk-label dk-label--req">交易方式</text>
              <view class="dk-row">
                <view class="dk-tabs">
                  <view class="dk-tab {{form.transaction_type === 'PLATFORM' ? 'dk-tab--on' : ''}}" data-type="PLATFORM" bindtap="pickTransactionType">平台交易</view>
                  <view class="dk-tab {{form.transaction_type === 'PICKUP' ? 'dk-tab--on' : ''}}" data-type="PICKUP" bindtap="pickTransactionType">自提</view>
                </view>
                <text class="dk-help">自提没有服务费</text>
              </view>
            </view>

            <view class="dk-field" wx:if="{{form.transaction_type === 'PLATFORM'}}">
              <text class="dk-label dk-label--req">成交店铺</text>
              <picker mode="selector" range="{{shopLabels}}" value="{{shopIndex}}" bindchange="onShopChange">
                <view class="dk-select {{form.shop_name ? '' : 'dk-muted'}}">{{form.shop_name || (shopLabels.length ? '请选择成交店铺' : '暂无可用店铺')}}</view>
              </picker>
            </view>
            <view class="dk-field" wx:if="{{form.transaction_type === 'PLATFORM'}}">
              <text class="dk-label">闲鱼服务费</text>
              <input class="dk-input" placeholder="订单页上的服务费，还没出来先空着" type="digit" data-key="platform_fee" value="{{form.platform_fee}}" bindinput="onInput" />
            </view>
            <view class="dk-field">
              <text class="dk-label">买家昵称</text>
              <input class="dk-input" placeholder="选填" data-key="buyer_name" value="{{form.buyer_name}}" bindinput="onInput" />
            </view>
            <view class="dk-field">
              <text class="dk-label">买家手机号</text>
              <input class="dk-input" placeholder="选填" type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{form.buyer_phone}}" bindinput="onPhoneInput" />
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="dk-card">
        <view class="dk-card__head">
          <text>物流与凭证</text>
        </view>
        <view class="dk-card__body">
          <view class="dk-form">
            <view class="dk-field">
              <text class="dk-label">快递运单号</text>
              <input class="dk-input" placeholder="邮寄发货填写，选填" data-key="tracking_no" value="{{form.tracking_no}}" bindinput="onInput" />
            </view>
            <view class="dk-field">
              <text class="dk-label">快递费</text>
              <input class="dk-input" placeholder="0.00，选填" type="digit" data-key="express_fee" value="{{form.express_fee}}" bindinput="onInput" />
            </view>
            <view class="dk-field dk-field--full">
              <text class="dk-label dk-label--req">成交凭证（至少 1 个，最多 3 个）</text>
              <text class="dk-help">聊天 / 收款截图，图片或视频（已传 {{form.evidence_urls.length}} 个）</text>
              <view class="ms-dk-evidence">
                <media-gallery wx:if="{{form.evidence_urls.length}}" urls="{{form.evidence_urls}}" display-urls="{{evidenceDisplayUrls}}" thumb-size="medium" />
                <view wx:if="{{form.evidence_urls.length < 3}}" class="ms-dk-add" bindtap="uploadEvidence">
                  <text class="ms-dk-add__plus">+</text>
                  <text>{{form.evidence_urls.length ? '继续追加' : '上传凭证'}}</text>
                </view>
              </view>
            </view>
            <view class="dk-field dk-field--full">
              <text class="dk-label">备注</text>
              <textarea class="dk-input ms-dk-textarea" placeholder="可选" data-key="remark" value="{{form.remark}}" bindinput="onInput" />
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="dk-card">
      <view class="dk-card__head">
        <text>商品</text>
        <text wx:if="{{sku}}" class="dk-link ms-dk-headlink" bindtap="goSkuDetail">详情 ›</text>
      </view>
      <view class="dk-card__body">
        <view wx:if="{{skuLoading}}" class="dk-empty ms-dk-empty">查询商品中…</view>
        <view wx:elif="{{skuError}}" class="ms-dk-err">{{skuError}}</view>
        <block wx:elif="{{sku}}">
          <view class="dk-media">
            <image
              wx:if="{{sku.cover_thumb_url || sku.cover_url}}"
              class="dk-thumb dk-thumb--lg"
              src="{{sku.cover_thumb_url || sku.cover_url}}"
              mode="aspectFill"
              data-url="{{sku.cover_url || sku.cover_thumb_url}}"
              bindtap="dkPreview"
            />
            <view wx:else class="dk-thumb dk-thumb--lg ms-dk-icon">{{sku.product_name ? sku.product_name[0] : '货'}}</view>
            <view class="dk-grow">
              <view class="dk-cell-main">{{sku.product_name}}</view>
              <view class="dk-cell-sub">{{sku.spec || '—'}}</view>
              <view class="dk-cell-sub">{{sku.sku_code}}<text wx:if="{{sku.suggest_price}}"> · 参考价 ¥{{sku.suggest_price}}</text></view>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{sku.on_shelf_count > 0}}" class="ms-dk-warn ms-dk-gap">仍在 {{sku.on_shelf_count}} 个店铺在架，出库后会自动下架</view>
        </block>
        <view wx:else class="dk-empty ms-dk-empty">扫码或输入货号后自动带出商品</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="dk-actionbar ms-dk-bar">
    <text class="dk-sub">成交价</text>
    <text class="ms-dk-amount">¥{{form.sale_price || '0.00'}}</text>
    <view class="dk-btn dk-btn--primary {{submitting ? 'dk-btn--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting ? '提交中…' : '确认成交并出库'}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
